Third-party model weights
-------------------------

Running IMGEN downloads and executes third-party model weights that are
NOT covered by the MIT License of this repository:

  * Qwen-Image-2.1
    Hugging Face : https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1
    ModelScope   : https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1
    License      : Qwen Research License
                   Review the official LICENSE before use.

  * Image21-INT8 (community bitsandbytes INT8 conversion by ixim)
    Hugging Face : https://huggingface.co/ixim/Image21-INT8
    ModelScope   : https://modelscope.cn/models/iximbox/Image21-INT8
    License      : Qwen Research License (derivative of Qwen-Image-2.1)
    Loader helper `imgen/int8_runtime.py` is adapted from
    `ixim/Image21-INT8` `scripts/runtime.py` and retains the upstream
    comments and behaviour.

  * Image21-INT4 (community SDNQ UINT4 conversion by ixim)
    Hugging Face : https://huggingface.co/ixim/Image21-INT4
    ModelScope   : https://modelscope.cn/models/iximbox/Image21-INT4
    License      : Qwen Research License (derivative of Qwen-Image-2.1)
    Loader helper `imgen/int4_runtime.py` is adapted from the upstream
    `scripts/runtime.py` and `scripts/device.py`. It preserves saved UINT4
    quantization, device placement and CPU VAE offload, with lazy imports
    and without changing the application's hub cache configuration.

